  </ContentSection>
  <ContentSection>
    <h2>Join the Music Team</h2>
    <p class="body-copy">We are always eager to welcome new people to our music team. If you sing or play an instrument, and are interested in helping the community at St John’s worship God through music, then please reach out to our music minister, Sam Giddy.</p>
  </ContentSection>
</Page>
